acy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/f52ae93a10858611b8dc60b054b2160f.poster.avif?t=1770475998\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/f52ae93a10858611b8dc60b054b2160f.webm?t=1770475998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/f52ae93a10858611b8dc60b054b2160f.mp4?t=1770475998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONIZE YOUR CONVERSATIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Emerald City, talk isn't cheap\u2014it's inspiration. Engage in high-stakes &quot;Conversation Battles&quot; to extract secrets, moods, and thoughts from the city\u2019s NPCs. Every character maintains a dynamic diary based on their unique personality; win the argument, and you win their truth. These secrets aren't just gossip\u2014they are the raw lyrical fuel for your next platinum record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/29f150d3b3d686075b4086aedd9f14e3.poster.avif?t=1770475998\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/29f150d3b3d686075b4086aedd9f14e3.webm?t=1770475998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/29f150d3b3d686075b4086aedd9f14e3.mp4?t=1770475998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE DRAG-AND-DROP ANTHEM CREATOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write real music with a powerful, intuitive drag-and-drop song crafter. Mix genres, select your gear, and weave the inspirations you\u2019ve gathered from the streets into your lyrics. Follow the trends to make a quick buck, or defy the status quo to start a movement. Once the track is finished, it\u2019s time to take it to the stage and see if the crowd bites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/b0284e6da1e78c608d9133fed1c36906.poster.avif?t=1770475998\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/b0284e6da1e78c608d9133fed1c36906.webm?t=1770475998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/extras/b0284e6da1e78c608d9133fed1c36906.mp4?t=1770475998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BACKSTAGE ACCESS: KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Living 90's Ecosystem: Experience a procedurally generated city. No two playthroughs feature the same rivals, bandmates, or heartbreakers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Life Management: Balance your creativity, talent, band, and relationships. Every hour counts when you\u2019re choosing between rehearsal and a nap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lyric Notebook: Turn NPC secrets into song lyrics. The more you know about the city\u2019s inhabitants, the more powerful your songs become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Modular Songwriting: Don't just &quot;click to write.&quot; Use the Drag-and-Drop Song Crafter to create your bands entire discography.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Battle of the Bands&quot;: It\u2019s not just a rhythm game. You\u2019ll need to scout your rivals, sabotage their hype, and customize your stage setup to win over specific subcultures. And, you'll play the actual songs <strong>you wrote</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear &amp; Growth: Collect vintage 90s-inspired guitars, amps, and pedals. Level up your charisma, talent, and songwriting to unlock your path to the Mainstage!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE SCENE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just watch from the side of the stage. Help us build the ultimate rockstar experience! We\u2019re a very small team dedicated to capturing the raw energy of the 90s, and your feedback is vital!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist!</strong> Get notified the second we go live and help us climb the charts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord:</strong> Share your song builds, show off your character\u2019s style, and talk shop with the devs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the Tour:</strong> Get behind-the-scenes updates on our development journey as we head toward our 2027 release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fingers on the Moon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309880/63fac98d2ed30e139000cfa26e1fa0d5f0bf5fa1/header.jpg?t=1770475998","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3309880/916366185/1793a5509b0f2abc1d8d0ed61e1749ee0123ae44/1770059471/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770060929","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/330988